Rule 5 (out tensor's data type must be compatible with the result of floor_divide(input, other))
{input : tensor, other : tensor, out : tensor} |= if (dtype_(input) = "bool" ∨ dtype_(other) = "bool") then dtype_(out) ≠ "bool"
>>
Rule 8 (input and other tensors should have compatible number of dimensions)
{input : tensor, other : tensor} |= ndim(input) = ndim(other)
>>
Rule 14 (If input is a tensor and other is a number, out should not be a bool if input is a bool.)
{input : tensor, out : tensor} |= if dtype_(input) = "bool" then dtype_(out) ≠ "bool"
